68, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6wcs.jpg"}, {"id": 321871, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc6wcv.jpg"}], "slug": "little-nightmares-ii", "storyline": "Mono, a boy wearing a paper bag over his head, awakens alone in a dark forest haunted by recurring dreams of a hallway and a door marked with an eye. After discovering Six imprisoned in a remote shack, the two children escape her captor and drift toward the Pale City, a fog-shrouded urban ruin littered with old television sets. Drawn by some connection between the televisions and his strange dreams, Mono pushes deeper into the city alongside Six, passing through a schoolhouse ruled by monstrous figures and a hospital crawling with unsettling patients. Ahead of them looms the Signal Tower, the source of a pervasive broadcast that has twisted the city and its inhabitants into something terrible.", "summary": "Little Nightmares II is a puzzle-platformer and survival horror game in which players control Mono, a young boy navigating a nightmarish world warped by the transmission of a distant Signal Tower. Gameplay combines environmental puzzle-solving with stealth and light combat, as Mono and his AI companion Six work together to evade grotesque enemies and traverse dangerous environments. The game is a prequel to the original Little Nightmares and features collectible items that unlock additional story content.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/little-nightmares-ii", "videos": [{"id": 47631, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "AI9zBBTyX-E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AI9zBBTyX-E", "title": "Little Nightmares II - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AI9zBBTyX-E/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 29473, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "OaTz44jLYd4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaTz44jLYd4", "title": "Little Nightmares 2 Reveal Trailer ( Gamescom 2019)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OaTz44jLYd4/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 5984, "name": "Little Nightmares"}]}